# i18n & Theme

- All user-facing strings via `t(key)` — no hardcoded English/BM in views/widgets
- All colors via theme tokens / `useTheme()` — no raw hex in presentation layer
- Locales: `en` | `bm`; ThemeMode: `light` | `dark` | `system`
- Persist preferences in preferences store (AsyncStorage)
